{% comment %}
  Are the "spend more, save more" tiers switched on? Echoes 1 when they are, nothing when not.
  Theme settings → Zenith · Cart → Show the % off tiers. Independent of the promotion switch on purpose
  (the client's automatic discounts run all the time).
  Read by zenith-cart-tier-pct, zenith-cart-offers and zenith-cart-summary, so they cannot disagree.
  Usage:
    {%- capture tiers_on -%}{%- render 'zenith-cart-tiers-on' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if tiers_on != blank -%}…{%- endif -%}
{% endcomment %}
{%- if settings.cart_tiers_on -%}1{%- endif -%}
